---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Psychosocial Counselling in Kathmandu, Nepal" 
  description="Confidential psychosocial counselling in Kathmandu for stress, relationships, grief, work and life changes. In person or online. Request a consultation."
>
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-[#F5F1EA] to-white pt-16 pb-12 border-b border-[#e2e8f0]">
    <div class="container-nh max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <span class="text-[11px] font-extrabold tracking-[0.2em] text-[#D84315] uppercase">Clinical Practice</span>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#173A7A] leading-tight">Psychosocial Counselling in Kathmandu</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-[#475569] leading-relaxed">
        Psychosocial counselling is a confidential, supportive conversation with a trained counsellor. It helps you understand your difficulties, strengthen your coping skills and make choices about your life.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12 bg-white">
    <div class="container-nh max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 space-y-10 text-[#475569] leading-relaxed">
      
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#173A7A] mb-4">What counselling can help with</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li>Stress, burnout and pressure at work or in studies</li>
          <li>Anxiety and low mood</li>
          <li>Relationship, couples and family difficulties</li>
          <li>Grief, loss and major life changes</li>
          <li>Career and study decisions</li>
          <li>Self-esteem and confidence</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#173A7A] mb-4">Why many people wait too long</h2>
        <p>In Nepal, as elsewhere, stigma is a real barrier. Many people fear being labelled, judged or talked about by family and community, so they hide their struggles until they become severe. Needing support is not weakness. People seek counselling because life is hard, and talking to a trained, neutral person helps.</p>
      </div>
      
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 bg-[#173A7A] text-center text-white">
    <div class="container-nh max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold">Request a consultation today.</h2>
      <div class="mt-8">
        <a href="https://portal.nepalhypnosis.com/form/consultation-request" target="_blank" class="rounded-xl bg-[#D84315] px-8 py-3.5 text-[15px] font-bold text-white shadow-md hover:bg-[#b93812] transition">Request a Consultation</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>